### CLI-5 follow-up: wallet inspect refuses container-valued fields

- `wallet inspect` printed whatever value a public-allowlisted field held — in keystore formats where `encrypted` carries the whole crypto object, `--field encrypted` would dump the ciphertext. `--field` now refuses dict/list values and the full view prints `<redacted: structured value>` in their place — scalars only. `cli/tests/test_wallet_inspect.py` gains a keystore fixture with object-valued `encrypted` plus a list-valued public field.
